          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[01:15] Quick Check:</strong> Into how many military occupation zones did the Big Three agree to divide defeated Germany and the city of Berlin at the February 1945 Yalta Conference?</li><li><strong>[02:45] Hinge Question:</strong> How did conflicting interpretations of the \"Declaration on Liberated Europe\" regarding democratic elections in Poland create immediate distrust between Britain/USA and the Soviet Union?</li></ol>",
