          "viewing_task": "<ol><li><strong>[08:45] Recall:</strong> What failed CIA-backed invasion of Cuba in April 1961 convinced Fidel Castro and Nikita Khrushchev that the US was actively plotting to overthrow the Cuban government?</li><li><strong>[26:30] Explain:</strong> Explain the incident on Soviet submarine B-59 on 27 October 1962 (\"Black Saturday\"): how did officer Vasili Arkhipov single-handedly prevent a nuclear catastrophe?</li><li><strong>[38:15] Challenge:</strong> Evaluate why Nikita Khrushchev was ousted from power by the Soviet Politburo in 1964: did the resolution of the Cuban Missile Crisis brand him as reckless or weak?</li></ol>",
